@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram


[*] --> Login

state Login
Login : entry / display journey details
Login : do / view journey details
Login : exit / user decides next action

state "User Decision" as UserDecision <<choice>>
Login --> UserDecision [valid]

state DrivingMode
DrivingMode : entry / activate driving mode or choose other options
DrivingMode : do / user selects option
DrivingMode : exit / action taken

state EatOption
EatOption : entry / select place to eat
EatOption : do / view menu and order if hungry
EatOption : exit / order placed

state AccidentNotification
AccidentNotification : entry / inform authorities in case of accident
AccidentNotification : do / send notifications during driving or in case of an accident
AccidentNotification : exit / notification sent

state Feedback
Feedback : entry / provide feedback upon journey completion
Feedback : do / user provides feedback
Feedback : exit / feedback submitted

UserDecision --> DrivingMode [invalid]
UserDecision --> EatOption [valid]
UserDecision --> AccidentNotification [invalid]
UserDecision --> Feedback [invalid]

[*] --> LoggedOut

LoggedOut --> [*]

@enduml
